  "notes": "The off-screen voice that explains or tells the story in documentaries, variety shows, commercials, and films. The act of narrating is ナレーション.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {声優|せいゆう}: voice actor — performs character voices for anime and dubbing, rather than explanatory narration\n- アナウンサー: announcer — a station broadcaster; may also do narration",
